END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  Your kingdom has reached level 5 in Navigation.  At 
levels 5 and up, you keep the plus 1 Naval move per level, but the usual 20% 
per level increase in sea strength is gone.  Instead, all characters of this 
exalted level are awarded the following Advanced Ability: 
  NAVAL LONG DEFEND:  The "Long Naval Defend" ability increases the range 
for the Defend order for naval forces.  The character will defend against an 
attack on any province that is: a) 2 or less hexes away from the leader, and 
b) 2 or less hexes away from the stated hex to defend.  For example, if the 
character is in a land province, and an adjacent land province is invaded, 
he can respond to the invasion by moving into an adjacent friendly sea 
province, then into the province under attack.  Even if the province is 2 
hexes away, only 1 movement point is used.  The character must lead at least 1
Fleet, Mermen or Whale unit to use this ability.  Note: with the "Move" 
command, you can't use this ability to "skip" a province.


